&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Overall 8+ years of relevant experience in Key Account Management/Sales in B2B space.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of best customer service practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
