&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Go-getter attitude.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
