&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a motivated and passionate Sales Manager to drive our Mid-Market and Enterprise business across South East Asia. This is a pure Mid-Market and Enterprise hunting role, focused on winning and growing Razorpay&#39;s largest merchant relationships in the region. Joining Razorpay at this early stage offers an exciting opportunity to be part of a dynamic team and shape the future of digital payments in the region. If you have the drive to make a meaningful impact within the industry, we invite you to apply for this role and contribute to Razorpay&#39;s journey in becoming the leading fintech partner in the market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently achieve Mid-Market and Enterprise sales targets and strive hard to challenge the competition landscape in the industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, maintain and forecast a healthy pipeline of Mid-Market and Enterprise opportunities to achieve business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end Mid-Market and Enterprise sales cycle — including long, complex, multi-stakeholder deal cycles, commercial negotiation and RFP processes — while working collaboratively with Marketing, Onboarding, Integration, Risk and other internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Should be responsible for understanding complex Mid-Market and Enterprise client requirements &amp;amp; propose a suitable solution using Razorpay payment products and services, engaging CXO, Finance, Product and Technology stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energetic self-starter with the ability to work independently in a fast-paced environment with a proven track record.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mandatory Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6-10 years of overall experience in the Merchant acquiring space with either payment or Fintech companies, with a majority of it spent selling to Mid-Market and Enterprise merchants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established and existing network across a Mid-Market and Enterprise merchant base in Singapore, with a proven track record of closing large, complex deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong communication, oral &amp;amp; written skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Highly self-motivated and result-oriented personality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills and an ability to build rapport with, and credibility among, senior and CXO-level stakeholders at large merchants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hardworking person with a strong work ethic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to leverage AI to drive competitive advantage and improve productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
