&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an &lt;strong&gt;Senior Associate&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to lead sales execution for &lt;strong&gt;RazorpayX. &lt;/strong&gt;This role sits at the convergence of fintech innovation and early-stage business growth. You will be responsible for developing the pipeline, nurturing it to closure and maintaining a strong relationship with the client until they are handed over to the Relationship Manager, ensuring end-to-end ownership of key accounts and high-quality execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a great opportunity for someone who has mastered high-velocity B2B sales, is ready to own KPIs across multiple levers, and help build scalable sales motions from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Funnel Sales Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and drive your personal sales funnel through outbound prospecting, discovery calls, demos, and closing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultative Sales:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead discovery conversations with a sharp understanding of the client&#39;s financial operations and offer tailored RazorpayX solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Prospecting:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and implement outreach strategies for untapped sectors within emerging businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Initiative Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify product gaps, process inefficiencies, or new verticals and run mini-projects to address them with cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with different teams internally like Product, Implementation, Support to provide a strong solution for the prospect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Tracking:&lt;/strong&gt; Use data and insights to track sales funnel performance, identify drop-off points, and suggest improvements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
