&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of B2B sales experience with focus on cold calling and market visits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record in consultative selling with mid and senior level prospects including C-suite leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in CRM tools (e.g., Salesforce, HubSpot) and disciplined in sales documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High energy, resourceful, and comfortable operating with limited playbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
