&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: times new roman, serif;&quot;&gt;We are seeking an enthusiastic and detail-oriented Accounting professional to manage key Accounts Payable processes within the finance function of Razorpay. The incumbent will work closely with the finance team and many other departments and external stakeholders&amp;nbsp; to ensure efficient management of the accounts payable function, accurate financial reporting, compliance with statutory requirements, and implementation of best practices and controls&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: times new roman, serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: times new roman, serif;&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: times new roman, serif;&quot;&gt;Invoice Processing &amp;amp; Vendor Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: times new roman, serif;&quot;&gt;Review, code, and enter vendor invoices, purchase orders (POs), and contracts into the accounting/ERP software&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: times new roman, serif;&quot;&gt;Perform 3-way matching (Invoice vs. Purchase Order vs. SOD) to ensure payment accuracy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: times new roman, serif;&quot;&gt;Handle vendor onboarding, verify bank details, and maintain active, compliant vendor master records&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: times new roman, serif;&quot;&gt;Address vendor payment inquiries and resolve billing/discrepancy issues in a timely, professional manner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: times new roman, serif;&quot;&gt;Statutory Compliance &amp;amp; Tax Deductions (India)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: times new roman, serif;&quot;&gt;Ensure accurate deduction and filing support for &lt;strong&gt;TDS (Tax Deductions at Source)&lt;/strong&gt; on qualifying vendor payments under relevant Sections (e.g., 194C, 194J, 194Q).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: times new roman, serif;&quot;&gt;Verify GST details on incoming invoices to ensure valid &lt;strong&gt;Input Tax Credit (ITC)&lt;/strong&gt; claimability (matching with GSTR-2B data).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: times new roman, serif;&quot;&gt;Payment Processing &amp;amp; Reconciliations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: times new roman, serif;&quot;&gt;Assist in preparing batch electronic payouts via Corporate Net Banking, ACH, NEFT, RTGS, and FinTech payment payout rails/APIs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: times new roman, serif;&quot;&gt;Reconcile vendor ledgers, monthly supplier statements, and petty cash logs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: times new roman, serif;&quot;&gt;Assist in month-end AP closing routines, aging analysis, and expense accrual computations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: times new roman, serif;&quot;&gt;Employee Expenses &amp;amp; Audit Support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: times new roman, serif;&quot;&gt;Process employee expense reports and reimbursements via corporate tools in line with company travel and expense policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: times new roman, serif;&quot;&gt;Maintain digital repository for all receipts, tax invoices, contracts, and payment vouchers for easy retrieval.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
