&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re hiring AI Builders: AI-first people from product, data or business backgrounds who find a real business problem, ship a working AI solution themselves, and get it adopted. Think an early-career founder, founding PM or analyst who already builds with AI on the side or full-time, not an engineer who waits for a spec. You won&#39;t own one layer of a system. You&#39;ll own an outcome: talk to the team with the problem, decide what to build, put together a v1 with modern AI tools (code, no-code or agents, whatever is fastest), and drive it until people actually use it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Work AI-first: use AI by default to research, prototype, analyse and automate, and help the teams you work with do the same • Sit with business and ops teams, find the problems worth solving, and size them in time, money or risk • Ship a working v1 yourself in days, using AI coding tools, agents, no-code or whatever gets there fastest • Get it adopted: onboard the first users, measure usage and impact, and iterate until it sticks • Decide fast what to scale, change or kill, and say why • Stay ahead of new models and tools, and know quickly which ones matter for your problems &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re AI-first.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;AI is your default way to research, build and ship, not an add-on. You try new models and tools early and have a view on what&#39;s useful and what&#39;s hype.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ve built something from zero. &lt;/strong&gt;You founded something, joined a founding team or launched your own side product, and can say what happened to it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You start from the problem. &lt;/strong&gt;You can explain who had it, how you knew it was real and what metric moved.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You build with your own hands. &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;ve shipped AI-powered products or workflows yourself, with code, agents or no-code, and can show them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You get things adopted. &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;ve taken something from launch to real users, inside a company or in the market.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You communicate crisply. &lt;/strong&gt;You can explain a messy problem and your call on it in five minutes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You own outcomes. &lt;/strong&gt;No spec, no owner, no problem: you make the call and move.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
