&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About&amp;nbsp;Groww&amp;nbsp;Mutual&amp;nbsp;Fund&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Groww Mutual Fund is on a mission to make mutual fund investing simple, transparent, and accessible for every Indian. As a digital-first AMC, we aim to build strong partnerships with&amp;nbsp;distributors&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;advisors&amp;nbsp;who&amp;nbsp;share&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;customer-first&amp;nbsp;philosophy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every individual deserves the knowledge, tools, and confidence to make informed financial decisions. At Groww, we are making sure every Indian feels empowered to do so through a cutting-edge multi-product platform offering a variety of financial services. Our long-term vision is to become the trusted financial partner for millions of Indians.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our culture enables us to be what we are — India’s fastest growing financial services company. It fosters an environment where collaboration, transparency, and open communication take center-stage and hierarchies fade away. There is space for every individual to be themselves and feel motivated to bring their best to the table, as well as craft a promising career for themselves.The values that form our foundation are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Radical&amp;nbsp;customer&amp;nbsp;centricity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership-driven&amp;nbsp;culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keeping&amp;nbsp;everything&amp;nbsp;simple&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Long-term&amp;nbsp;thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete&amp;nbsp;transparency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain strong relationships with IFAs and MFDs to promote Groww Mutual Fund offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve assigned sales and AUM targets through consistent partner engagement and field activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular product training sessions and provide marketing support to partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify new business opportunities and onboard potential distributors in the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide ongoing service, support, and updates on product changes or new launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with all regulatory and internal policies during interactions and sales activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred candidate profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduate/Postgraduate in Finance, Business, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-7 years of experience in mutual fund distribution or sales, especially in the IFA/MFD ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of mutual fund products and the distribution channel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, presentation, and relationship management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energetic, proactive, and target-oriented approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

